{"id":"NCT02880631","title":"BAROSTIM THERAPY™ In Resistant Hypertension","official":"BAROSTIM THERAPY™ In Resistant Hypertension: A Post-Market Registry With the CE-Marked BAROSTIM NEO™ System","summary":"The purpose of this registry (NCT02880631) is to evaluate the effect of BAROSTIM THERAPY with the BAROSTIM NEO System in the commercial setting in subjects recently implanted under the CE-Marked indication for resistant hypertension.","conditions":["Hypertension"],"interventions":[{"type":"DEVICE","name":"BAROSTIM NEO™ System"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Has signed an EC approved informed consent form\n* Has been implanted with the BAROSTIM NEO system in the past 30 days\n* Systolic blood pressure greater than or equal to 140 mmHg, and\n* Resistance to maximally tolerated therapy with a diuretic and two other anti-hypertension medications\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Bilateral carotid bifurcations located above the level of the mandible\n* Baroreflex failure or autonomic neuropathy\n* Uncontrolled, symptomatic cardiac bradyarrhythmias\n* Carotid atherosclerosis that is determined by ultrasound or angiographic evaluation to be greater than 50%\n* Ulcerative plaques in the carotid artery as determined by ultrasound or angiographic evaluation","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":500,"start":"2016-12-13","pcd":"2027-07","upd":"2026-09-11","sponsor":"CVRx, Inc.","areas":["other"],"central":["Nicole Baumann · 763-416-2331 · nbaumann@cvrx.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Charité Benjamin Franklin","city":"Berlin","pr":"","zip":"12203","s":"ANR","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105,"c":""},{"f":"Charité Campus Virchow","city":"Berlin","pr":"","zip":"13353","s":"ANR","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105,"c":""},{"f":"Immanuel Klinikum Bernau Herzzentrum Brandenburg","city":"Bernau","pr":"","zip":"16321","s":"R","lat":47.8002,"lon":8.0383,"c":"Daniela Bettin · +49 333 869 4604 · d.bettin@immanuel.de"},{"f":"Cloppenburg Katho